Slip into a lucid dream.  While in this state, you are considered sleeping, but can still act, are immune to insomnia, inflict [13%, 18%, 22%, 25%, 28% (TL1-5; MP 100)] more damage to targets under the effects of Insomnia, and your Physical, Mental, and Spell saves are increased by [13, 18, 22, 25, 28 (TL1-5; MP 100)].

Note that being asleep may make you more vulnerable to certain effects (such as Inner Demons, Night Terror, and Waking Nightmare).

The saving throw bonuses scale with your Mindpower.
